fastllm.exe
fastllm.exe~
/fastllm
fastllm-cli.exe
/fastllm-cli
.fastllm.launched
fastllm.db
fastllm.db-shm
fastllm.db-wal
fastllm.log

# `go build ./...` from repo root writes each main package's binary here
# named after its directory (cmd/server -> server)
# when run without -o — easy to do by accident when cross-compile-checking
# all packages at once.
/server
/cli
web/node_modules/
# web/dist is governed by web/.gitignore, which keeps the directory itself
# (web/embed.go does //go:embed all:dist) while ignoring the build output.
.env
fastllm_terminal_test.exe

# Local fastllm config. CandidateConfigPaths checks ./.fastllm/config.json
# before the one in $HOME, so a project-local config is what the TUI writes
# to — keep it out of the repo rather than trusting it to stay secret-free.
.fastllm/